OeDOPPPPPPPODdO
OeDOPPPPPPUODdO
OeDOOOOOOOOODdO
OeDDDDDDDDDDDdO
OdddddddddddddO
.OOOOOOOOOOOOO.

# Frame around Wolfgang's mood portrait: no gap, the picture sits right
# against the inner outline and the frame crops the bust at the bottom.
frame portrait-frame 11 11 slice 4
.OOOOOOOOO.
OeeeeeeeeeO
OeDDDDDDDdO
OeDOOOOODdO
OeDObbbODdO
OeDObbbODdO
OeDObbbODdO
OeDOOOOODdO
OeDDDDDDDdO
OdddddddddO
.OOOOOOOOO.

# Small buttons (settings, presets).
frame button 7 7 slice 2
.vvvvv.
vAAAAAv
vAAAAAv
vAAAAAv
vAAAAav
vaaaaav
.vvvvv.

frame button-on 7 7 slice 2
.OOOOO.
OYYYYYO
OYYYYYO
